{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Myko complete her entrance exam for the Royal Academy's School of Mycology by finding and cataloguing each of the mushrooms in her Exam Journal. Myko's journal is a puzzle that you must solve to figure out the when and where of a dynamic mushroom growth system. Time only moves when you decide to travel, and <i>you</i> get to choose when and how Myko completes her journey. Enjoy a self-paced cozy journey through natural landscapes while foraging for mushrooms and meeting kind characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 80 unique  mushrooms that dynamically grow based on day, time, and location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with a colorful cast of helpful characters, each of which have their own tiny stories  to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research found mushrooms to add their unique information to Myko's journal and complete the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send away extra mushrooms to the local village to help with daily requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit three charming landscapes each with their own set of mushrooms, characters, and locations to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe in the coziness of nature with a calming playlist of new music.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794280?t=1751408603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794280/7b3edbb4582ee1acb87c93d283f111328b954314/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751408603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794280/f03ba6b4cf6bebe401abd4d9a66a8495183fa3f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751408603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794280/f03ba6b4cf6bebe401abd4d9a66a8495183fa3f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751408603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Myko complete her entrance exam for the Royal Academy's School of Mycology by finding and cataloguing each of the mushrooms in her Exam Journal. Myko's journal is a puzzle that you must solve to figure out the when and where of a dynamic mushroom growth system. Time only moves when you decide to travel, and <i>you</i> get to choose when and how Myko completes her journey. Enjoy a self-paced cozy journey through natural landscapes while foraging for mushrooms and meeting kind characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 80 unique  mushrooms that dynamically grow based on day, time, and location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with a colorful cast of helpful characters, each of which have their own tiny stories  to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research found mushrooms to add their unique information to Myko's journal and complete the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send away extra mushrooms to the local village to help with daily requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit three charming landscapes each with their own set of mushrooms, characters, and locations to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe in the coziness of nature with a calming playlist of new music.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Charles V Fisher"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794280/939e57ed67086efe49998e8354332e11531fe627